<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>California Rain</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">James Marriott</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">California Rain</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">31jXrQbgx8DGcUh7NN4VY4</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.215" end="00:32.587">There's no clouds in California</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.587" end="00:37.166">And I can't wait to hear the rain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.166" end="00:41.780">I changed the seasons waiting for ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.780" end="00:49.780">I'm not the same as yesterday, yesterday, yesterday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.885" end="00:55.583">A 2-for-1 on anaesthesia</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.583" end="01:00.359">I tense too much to feel the pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.359" end="01:04.735">There's a thrift around the corner</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.735" end="01:12.735">That laundry bag was all in vain, all in vain, all in vain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.092" end="01:18.732">You're right, I'm not cut out for the big time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.732" end="01:23.330">Sit tight, I'm not far out from you tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.330" end="01:27.699">The time we've lost watching from the inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.699" end="01:30.570">I'm just a man, so what's the plan?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.570" end="01:38.570">The rain won't stop me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.618" end="01:46.367">I can't stop from cannonballing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.367" end="01:50.675">Down the stairs towards the bay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.675" end="01:55.285">I scrape the green off every morning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.285" end="02:03.285">Just too late to kiss your face, kiss your face, kiss your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.637" end="02:09.289">You're right, I'm not cut out for the big time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.289" end="02:13.898">Sit tight, I'm not far out from you tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.898" end="02:18.049">The time we've lost watching from the inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.049" end="02:21.126">I'm just a man, so what's the plan?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.126" end="02:25.859">The rain won't stop me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.859" end="02:30.386">The rain won't stop me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.386" end="02:34.958">The rain won't stop me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.958" end="02:41.317">The rain won't stop me—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.317" end="02:45.810">There's no clouds in California</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.810" end="02:50.279">And I can't wait to hear the rain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.279" end="02:55.011">I changed the seasons waiting for ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.011" end="02:59.011">I'm not the same as yesterday</p></div></body></tt>